{
  "openapi": "3.1.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "Drive English Listening Preference and Speaking Records",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "S3 planned extension, not deployed. Six protected operations use schema_version5 plus feature_contract_version1; original22 operations/JSON3 are unchanged. Verify JWT subject/session/installation. Profile/epoch are expected context, never authority. Daily preference is history-epoch independent; cards/time/visibility require current epoch. Mutation <=16 KiB; key equals operation_id. GET never evaluates, acknowledges delivery, changes resume or starts media/input. Actual route/codec/generator/DB support remains a follow-on gate."
  },
